      "sections": [
        {
          "key": "condition",
          "html": "<p>Ре­ши­те си­сте­му не­ра­венств</p><center><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\begin{cases}5x+13\\le 0\\\\x+5\\ge 1\\end{cases}\"></span> </p></center><p>На каком ри­сун­ке изоб­ра­же­но мно­же­ство ее ре­ше­ний?</p><i>В от­ве­те ука­жи­те номер пра­виль­но­го ва­ри­ан­та.</i><center><table data-layout=\"media-grid\"><tbody><tr><td>1) <p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"890d66c6-eb0f-4ec5-b796-31525d759329\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" src=\"/assets/890d66c6-eb0f-4ec5-b796-31525d759329\"/></p></td><td>2) <p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"e122787f-9e30-4139-bd6f-402729131832\" data-asset-key=\"image_2\" src=\"/assets/e122787f-9e30-4139-bd6f-402729131832\"/></p></td></tr></tbody></table><table data-layout=\"media-grid\"><tbody><tr><td>3) <p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"078b6747-eb10-4e9c-a87b-786a724dffe4\" data-asset-key=\"image_3\" src=\"/assets/078b6747-eb10-4e9c-a87b-786a724dffe4\"/></p></td><td>4) <p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"053c581a-e8bd-43bf-bf1f-a289a657c1fe\" data-asset-key=\"image_4\" src=\"/assets/053c581a-e8bd-43bf-bf1f-a289a657c1fe\"/></p></td></tr></tbody></table></center>",
